# Stage 4 Hackl (D-056, game-design.md "New mechanics"): the solver route
# to the church plateau (it jumps onto the H-box), then Resi stops on the
# plateau, walks under the H-box (164, row 8, 2 rows above the plateau), bumps it,
# and the Hackl rises onto it and stays; a straight jump beside the box with
# a drift left takes it (Normal -> Hackl, „Wirf, Resi, wirf!" + 1000) and
# she lands on the box. Facing right from the box top she throws an axe
# every 31 frames (new RUN presses): the first takes the Wolfgang pigeon off
# the statue, later ones defeat pilger group C (3 x 100, outside the stomp
# chain) on the saddle's clear axe lane. No hurt. E20 (D-065): on the box
# top the climb camera keeps the plateau's framing, so the lane and group C
# are on screen (shot box_lane: two pilgrims left, an axe in flight).
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = event=PowerUp no_event=Hurt deaths=0 score=6000
shots  = 1172:bump 1305:pickup 1680:axes 1700:box_lane
